  "description": "Please email enquiry only\n\nSHORT LET OPTION ONLY — 9th NOVEMBER 2026 TO 2nd APRIL 2027\n\nProperty Overview\n\nSet within the desirable Ballynoe Grove development in Bray, this beautifully maintained two-bedroom semi-detached home is ideally suited to clients seeking a comfortable short-term rental in a convenient and peaceful setting.\nLocated just off Kilbride Road, the property offers a bright and well-presented living environment while remaining within easy reach of Bray town centre, local amenities and transport links.\n\nKey Features\n\nSpacious Living Area:\nThe ground floor boasts a bright and airy living room together with a separate sunroom, providing an additional comfortable reception space.\n\nModern Kitchen:\nA fully equipped kitchen with contemporary fittings and ample storage, with access leading directly to the private rear garden.\n\nTwo Bedrooms:\nTwo well-sized bedrooms with excellent natural light, offering comfortable accommodation throughout.\n\nTwo Bathrooms:\nA family bathroom upstairs with a full-size bath, together with a downstairs WC for added convenience.\n\nPrivate Garden:\nA beautifully maintained private rear garden with decking.\n\nLocation Benefits\n\nConvenient Access:\nThe property enjoys easy access to Bray town centre, schools, shopping facilities and public transport.\n\nScenic Surroundings:\nLocated close to picturesque parks, coastal walks and the many outdoor amenities Bray has to offer.\n\nAdditional Information\n\nParking:\nOne designated car parking space, with visitor parking available subject to availability.\n\nHeating:\nAir-to-water heat pump.\n\nFurnishing:\nFully furnished as photographed.\n\nLetting Term:\nShort-term letting only, available from 9th November 2026 until 2nd April 2027.\n\nViewings will be arranged via email enquiry only.",
